{{\pard\plain \s4\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs20\cgrid 
La funci\'F3n handle_scroll:
\par}
{\tc\tcl4 \v La funci\'F3n handle_scroll:}
Esta es la implementaci\'F3n personalizada de la funci\'F3n de callback para manejar eventos de scroll: {
\par
\pard\plain \s40\li0\widctlpar\adjustright \shading1000\cbpat8 \f2\fs16\cgrid {\cf18 void}    handle_scroll({\cf18 double} xdelta, {\cf18 double} ydelta, {\cf18 void} *param)\par
\{\par
    t_data  *data;\par
\par
    (void)xdelta;\par
    data = (t_data *)param;\par
    {\cf19 if} (ydelta > 0)\par
        data->zoom *= ZOOM_IN;\par
    {\cf19 else}\par
        data->zoom *= ZOOM_OUT;\par
    render_fractal(data);\par
\}\par
}
\par}
