{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Calculates the color based on the number of iterations.\par
This function determines the color of each pixel in the fractal by mapping the iteration count (how many steps we are needed to reach a threshold) to a color gradient.\par
For non-technical users:{
\par
