00019 {\cf20  * This file handles all calculations and rendering logic for he Julia set}\par
00020 {\cf20  *  fractal.}\par
00021 {\cf20  * It contains functions that:}\par
00022 {\cf20  * - Perrform the iterative mathematical calculations for each point in the}\par
00023 {\cf20  *   Julia set.}\par
00024 {\cf20  * - Render invidiaul rows of the fractal to optimize performance.}\par
