\par
\pard\plain \s120\fi-360\li360\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
{\b What is the Mandelbrot Set?}  The Mandelbrot set is a mathematical design created by repeatedly applying a simple formula to point on a grid. Points that "escape" quickly create bright colors, while points that stay "trapped" generate the darker areas of the fractal. \par}
\par
\par}
